Z||000010||Tryxalon||10-08-2001||09:33 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pontiatic:<BR><B>ok ok so his 83 Jetta would toast me?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Or you could ask him why he hates his car so much that he wants to take the chance of destroying it in a race rather than enjoying it? <P>Or ask him does he really enjoy paying tickets? <P>Or ask him if he wants to street race because he has a death wish? <P>Then ask him to put up the admission fee on a closed legal race track so the two of you can test things legally in safely. If he REALLY thinks his car is that fast, he should be ready to back up his mouth with money. He should also pay your's since it is his idea!! <P>(and yes, all that is a psyche job. But it is one that you can continue to run until you find someone with more money than sense. They you get to drive on a real race course with him paying and you can graciously admit -- "yep, you beat me, that day and that time, only." ) <BR>||||reg||1
